      "message": "fix(sim): read the cross drill's first traverse with the tool's stack, let a touch pass\n\nThe lathe post's first G00 X Z goes to the end of move 0 (the R-plane\npoint). The swept solid follows the flute, shank and holder bands, a\nface flush with the first point passes, and a coarse model's excess\ngrows the work.\n\nRefs #3077\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
