      "message": "fix(sim): the cross drill's first traverse follows the #1053 excess law\n\nThe model excess tightens the touch tolerance while one is left; past\nthat the law reads the facets untightened, as every other cross-drill\nlaw does.\n\nRefs #3077\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
