      "message": "test(app): raise the cross recognition case's clearance clear of its box stock\n\nThe 44 box stock stands out to X 22 from Z 0 up; at clearance 20 the\nfirst hole's R plane is at radius 20, so the lathe post's first rapid\ncomes down through 2 mm of uncut stock. Clearance 30 puts it outside.\n\nFixes #3077\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
